*> Test of 30 part 5 section 5, Daylight detector (core/src/redstone-30-5.cob; T0772): the ticker phase, updateSignalStrength with the table cosine in binary32, the inverted mode and use.
*> A case loads its inputs from a text of numbers (LOAD-IN fills WS-I as integers and WS-FX as doubles), calls the program
*> and shows the outputs WS-R(1..WS-N) joined by "/", one group per call; expected values come from the rules and tables of the section.
 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
 PROGRAM-ID. TEST-REDSTONE-30-5-5.
 DATA DIVISION.
 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
 COPY TESTLIB.
 COPY INTERACT.
